    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Capitalist Misadventures, you start off with a crumbling shack in your grandpa\u2019s backyard and a $100 loan from a very shady lender. Is that all you\u2019ll need to launch your empire and get filthy rich?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire and <i>invest</i> in a questionable workforce \u2014 from panhandlers and crypto miners to stray cats with ambition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the stock market... or gamble your fortune in <i>less conventional</i> ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge documents, dodge taxes, and do whatever it takes to stay ahead. Ethics are optional.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your company! Grow your tiny shack into a ridiculous corporate powerhouse with more money than morals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring <strong>jaw-droppingly realistic</strong> graphics, get a taste of what it's like to be a ruthless, exploitative entrepreneur in this game that scored a perfect 10 according to my grandma, Gigi.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Capitalist Misadventures, you start off with a crumbling shack in your grandpa\u2019s backyard and a $100 loan from a very shady lender. Is that all you\u2019ll need to launch your empire and get filthy rich?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire and <i>invest</i> in a questionable workforce \u2014 from panhandlers and crypto miners to stray cats with ambition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the stock market... or gamble your fortune in <i>less conventional</i> ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge documents, dodge taxes, and do whatever it takes to stay ahead. Ethics are optional.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your company! Grow your tiny shack into a ridiculous corporate powerhouse with more money than morals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring <strong>jaw-droppingly realistic</strong> graphics, get a taste of what it's like to be a ruthless, exploitative entrepreneur in this game that scored a perfect 10 according to my grandma, Gigi.</p>",
    "short_description": "Get ready for a bizarre capitalist challenge in this labor exploitation simulator, where your goal is to turn your tiny shack into a mega-corporation with megalomaniac capital. Hire beggars, stray kittens, and even TikTokers\u2014and monetize their services!",
